            <ArticleTitle>Lipid profile in high risk children aged 2-10 years.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>630-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case-control study was conducted to study the Lipid profile of high risk children (age 2-10 years). There was a significant elevation of total cholesterol (P&lt;0.001) and LDL (P&lt; 0.001). Early dietary and lifestyle modifications can prevent this cascade.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
